  "startup_pitch": "Introducing Tipperary, a revolutionary app that simplifies the process of finding the average tip size for each restaurant. With Tipperary, users can easily determine the expected tip amount before their meal, eliminating the guesswork and saving time. Whether you're a frequent diner or a first-time visitor, Tipperary provides a convenient and accurate solution for tipping. Experience the convenience of Tipperary and discover the average tip size for your next restaurant visit. Download Tipperary today and start saving time and money on tipping! "
